  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indigenous peoples and sustainable landscapes in Brazil</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will support instruments for management of macro-landscapes as a strategy to reduce and reverse deforestation and forest degradation in the Cerrado and the Amazon as well as to strengthen the rights and well-being of indigenous peoples. Reducing and reversing deforestation and forest degradation is a fundamental motivation for this project.</narrative>
  </description>
